		(property "Description" "1.2 V core, 500 mA (UP5K core: a few mA to tens of mA). No basic 1.2 V LDO at JLCPCB. Fed from +5V (6 V max): VCC and VCCPLL are up before SPI_VCCIO1 and VPP_2V5 (+3V3, buck from +5V), the order the UltraPlus datasheet requires (§4.5, 0.5 V before the next supply). 0.1 W at 30 mA"
